{{also|buinn}}
==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Past participle of {{m|is|búa|t=to reside, prepare}}.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|@@}}

# [[complete]]d, [[finish]]ed, [[over]]
#: {{ux|is|Ertu '''búinn''' að fara út með ruslið?|Did you take out the trash?}}
#: {{ux|is|Er myndin '''búin'''?|Is the film '''over'''?}}
# [[deplete]]d, [[finish]]ed
#: {{ux|is|Því miður, kaffið er '''búið'''.|I'm afraid we don't have any more coffee.}}
# [[exhausted]]
# [[fit out|fitted out]], [[fit up|fitted up]], [[ready]]
#: {{syn|is|útbúinn}}
#: {{ux|is|Hersveitin var vel vopnum '''búin'''.|The squadron was '''heavily''' armed.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hún er vel '''búin'''.|She's warmly '''dressed'''.}}

